# Anything shaped like a member's own data, so a stray file in the working tree
# cannot become a commit. None of these belong in this repository at any point:
# a data home lives outside it, and the fixtures are synthetic and checked in
# deliberately. Listed by shape rather than by path because the mistake this
# guards against is a file appearing somewhere nobody expected.
secrets/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.zip
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
